flowchart TD
    O[Open project] --> L{Index current?}
    L -- brok-agent running --> S
    L -- stopped --> C[Start: catch up on changes] --> S[Search by meaning or name]
    S --> R[Open the source at its lines]
    S --> A[Ask, with files or selection attached]
    A --> Y{Model available?}
    Y -- yes --> AN[Answer with sources and activity]
    Y -- no --> IX[Index answer, with a way to connect a model]
    AN --> M[Remember a decision]
    AN --> H[Resume later from History]
    R --> V[Review changes]
    V --> CM[Commit message from the staged diff]
    O --> X[Other repositories: links or members, optional]
    X --> S
